            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "themama1978"
            },
            "reviewBody": "These are very close to the ones my mom used to make when I was a kid! I haven't had them in years! I don't know if anyone else ever did this but we used to dip them in white vinegar mixed into a paste with sugar. I know it sounds wierd but my mouth is watering just thinking about it!! Yum!",
